 Read on to learn how much it costs to build a room addition based on factors like location, type, and size. ","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-add-room.htm","image":"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/cosy-bedroom.jpg","datePublished":"02/03/2025, 12:00:00 AM UTC","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Tyler Lacoma","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/tyler-lacoma"}},"position":2},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@type":"Article","headline":"How Much Does It Cost to Remodel a Small Bathroom? [2025 Data]","description":"Small bathroom remodel costs depend on a number of factors—like what exactly you’re upgrading and the size of the room. This guide will help you budget.","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-remodel-small-bathrooms-and-half-baths.htm","image":"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/interior-small-bathroom-plants-479525525.jpeg","datePublished":"02/07/2025, 12:00:00 AM UTC","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Samantha Hawrylack","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/samantha-hawrylack"}},"position":3},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@type":"Article","headline":"How Much Does It Cost to Make My Home Wheelchair Accessible? [2025 Data]","description":"Making your house more accessible is a must for many homeowners, especially those with disabilities or older adults. Here’s what to expect when planning for accessibility improvements.","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-make-my-home-handicap-accessible.htm","image":"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/handicapped-man-kitchen.jpg","datePublished":"01/20/2025, 12:00:00 AM UTC","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Mariel Loveland","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/mariel-loveland"}},"position":4},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@type":"Article","headline":"How Much Does Shower Pan Replacement Cost? [2025 Data]","description":"Shower pan replacement costs $530 to $2,700. Find out how material, shower size, labor, and more affect the final project budget.","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/shower-pan-replacement-cost.htm","image":"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/bathroom-gray-tones-heated-floors-133612723.jpeg","datePublished":"02/03/2025, 12:00:00 AM UTC","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Samantha Hawrylack","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/samantha-hawrylack"}},"position":5},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@type":"Article","headline":"How Much Does Bathtub Replacement Cost? [2025 Data]","description":"An updated bathtub can give a bathroom a whole new look. Find out how much it costs to replace a bathtub, including prices by type and labor costs.","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-bathtub-replacement-cost.htm","image":"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/modern-bathroom-saoking-tub.jpg","datePublished":"02/06/2025, 12:00:00 AM UTC","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Stephanie Mickelson","url":"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/stephanie-mickelson"}},"position":6}]}</script><div class="Hub_contentContainer__z8hmy"><div class="Hub_topContainer__KTyss"><div class="Hub_titleContainer__5kVkq"><div class="Hub_contentTitle__Y_KIA">The homeowners guide to home care is here</div><div class="Hub_contentSubtitle__OBxHm">From average costs to expert advice, get all the answers you need to get your job done.</div></div><div class="Hub_buttonContainer__AGE9w"><a data-testid="angi_button" href="https://www.angi.com/articles" data-snowplow-component-text="See All Articles" class="Button_btn__2q7Vd Button_secondaryNeutral__zwIJa">See all articles</a></div></div><div class="Hub_articles__Ma2RH"><div class="Card_cardContainer___7DME"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/laundry-room-addition-cost.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Image"><img class="Card_cardImg__iOQzE" alt="Modern Laundry Room" src="https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/modern-laundry-room.jpg"/></a><div><div class="Card_cardAuthorContainer__u4i_p"><div class="Card_cardAuthor__Ro5A1"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/author/deane-biermeier" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Author Name" class="Card_anchor__FH3O7">Deane Biermeier</a></div><div class="Card_cardDot__3PyZj">•</div><div class="Card_cardDate__JHLhK">Feb 10, 2025</div><div class="Card_cardDateMobile__EQDWZ">Feb 10, 2025</div></div><div><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/laundry-room-addition-cost.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Title" class="Card_cardTitle__72fz_">How Much Does a Laundry Room Addition Cost? [2025 Data]</a></div><div class="Card_cardText__FLji5">Building a laundry room addition to your home adds value and functionality. Your laundry room addition cost will depend on size, materials, and other factors.</div></div></div><div class="Card_cardContainer___7DME"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-add-room.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Image"><img class="Card_cardImg__iOQzE" alt="Interior of a cosy bedroom on a sunny day" src="https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/cosy-bedroom.jpg"/></a><div><div class="Card_cardAuthorContainer__u4i_p"><div class="Card_cardAuthor__Ro5A1"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/author/tyler-lacoma" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Author Name" class="Card_anchor__FH3O7">Tyler Lacoma</a></div><div class="Card_cardDot__3PyZj">•</div><div class="Card_cardDate__JHLhK">Feb 3, 2025</div><div class="Card_cardDateMobile__EQDWZ">Feb 3, 2025</div></div><div><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-add-room.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Title" class="Card_cardTitle__72fz_">How Much Does a Room Addition Cost? [2025 Data]</a></div><div class="Card_cardText__FLji5">Building an addition can increase your home&#x27;s value and provide more space to live, but it does come at a cost. Read on to learn how much it costs to build a room addition based on factors like location, type, and size. </div></div></div><div class="Card_cardContainer___7DME"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-remodel-small-bathrooms-and-half-baths.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Image"><img class="Card_cardImg__iOQzE" alt="The interior of a small bathroom with plants over the bathtub" src="https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/interior-small-bathroom-plants-479525525.jpeg"/></a><div><div class="Card_cardAuthorContainer__u4i_p"><div class="Card_cardAuthor__Ro5A1"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/author/samantha-hawrylack" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Author Name" class="Card_anchor__FH3O7">Samantha Hawrylack</a></div><div class="Card_cardDot__3PyZj">•</div><div class="Card_cardDate__JHLhK">Feb 7, 2025</div><div class="Card_cardDateMobile__EQDWZ">Feb 7, 2025</div></div><div><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-remodel-small-bathrooms-and-half-baths.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Title" class="Card_cardTitle__72fz_">How Much Does It Cost to Remodel a Small Bathroom? [2025 Data]</a></div><div class="Card_cardText__FLji5">Small bathroom remodel costs depend on a number of factors—like what exactly you’re upgrading and the size of the room. This guide will help you budget.</div></div></div><div class="Card_cardContainer___7DME"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-make-my-home-handicap-accessible.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Image"><img class="Card_cardImg__iOQzE" alt="Man in wheelchair washes dishes" src="https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/handicapped-man-kitchen.jpg"/></a><div><div class="Card_cardAuthorContainer__u4i_p"><div class="Card_cardAuthor__Ro5A1"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/author/mariel-loveland" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Author Name" class="Card_anchor__FH3O7">Mariel Loveland</a></div><div class="Card_cardDot__3PyZj">•</div><div class="Card_cardDate__JHLhK">Jan 20, 2025</div><div class="Card_cardDateMobile__EQDWZ">Jan 20, 2025</div></div><div><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-make-my-home-handicap-accessible.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Title" class="Card_cardTitle__72fz_">How Much Does It Cost to Make My Home Wheelchair Accessible? [2025 Data]</a></div><div class="Card_cardText__FLji5">Making your house more accessible is a must for many homeowners, especially those with disabilities or older adults. Here’s what to expect when planning for accessibility improvements.</div></div></div><div class="Card_cardContainer___7DME"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/shower-pan-replacement-cost.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Image"><img class="Card_cardImg__iOQzE" alt="Bathroom in gray tones with heated floors" src="https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/bathroom-gray-tones-heated-floors-133612723.jpeg"/></a><div><div class="Card_cardAuthorContainer__u4i_p"><div class="Card_cardAuthor__Ro5A1"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/author/samantha-hawrylack" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Author Name" class="Card_anchor__FH3O7">Samantha Hawrylack</a></div><div class="Card_cardDot__3PyZj">•</div><div class="Card_cardDate__JHLhK">Feb 3, 2025</div><div class="Card_cardDateMobile__EQDWZ">Feb 3, 2025</div></div><div><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/shower-pan-replacement-cost.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Title" class="Card_cardTitle__72fz_">How Much Does Shower Pan Replacement Cost? [2025 Data]</a></div><div class="Card_cardText__FLji5">Shower pan replacement costs $530 to $2,700. Find out how material, shower size, labor, and more affect the final project budget.</div></div></div><div class="Card_cardContainer___7DME"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-bathtub-replacement-cost.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Image"><img class="Card_cardImg__iOQzE" alt="Modern bathroom with a deep, freestanding soaking tub " src="https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/modern-bathroom-saoking-tub.jpg"/></a><div><div class="Card_cardAuthorContainer__u4i_p"><div class="Card_cardAuthor__Ro5A1"><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/author/stephanie-mickelson" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Author Name" class="Card_anchor__FH3O7">Stephanie Mickelson</a></div><div class="Card_cardDot__3PyZj">•</div><div class="Card_cardDate__JHLhK">Feb 6, 2025</div><div class="Card_cardDateMobile__EQDWZ">Feb 6, 2025</div></div><div><a href="https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-bathtub-replacement-cost.htm" data-snowplow-component-text="Article Title" class="Card_cardTitle__72fz_">How Much Does Bathtub Replacement Cost? [2025 Data]</a></div><div class="Card_cardText__FLji5">An updated bathtub can give a bathroom a whole new look. Find out how much it costs to replace a bathtub, including prices by type and labor costs.</div></div></div></div><div class="Hub_indicators__IoYYn"><div id="indicator-0" class="Hub_articlePointerIndicator__iFw__ Hub_pointerSelected__3J6h9"></div><div id="indicator-1" class="Hub_articlePointerIndicator__iFw__ Hub_pointerDefault__gQSLR"></div><div id="indicator-2" class="Hub_articlePointerIndicator__iFw__ Hub_pointerDefault__gQSLR"></div><div id="indicator-3" class="Hub_articlePointerIndicator__iFw__ Hub_pointerDefault__gQSLR"></div><div id="indicator-4" class="Hub_articlePointerIndicator__iFw__ Hub_pointerDefault__gQSLR"></div><div id="indicator-5" class="Hub_articlePointerIndicator__iFw__ Hub_pointerDefault__gQSLR"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-span-full w-full "><div class="mb-regular mb-regular-mobile "><div applicationName="landing-pages-frontend" brand="ANGI" eventGatewayBaseUrl="https://api.angi.com/event-gateway" pageName="Visitor : Home" subscriptionServiceBaseUrl="https://www.angi.com" subtext="Sign up to get free project cost info in your inbox." text="Knowledge is priceless - so our cost guides are free." buttonText="Sign me up" style="background-position:center" class="EmailSubscription_Container__kmirq" data-snowplow-component-type="Email Subscription"><div class="EmailSubscription_InnerContainer__gXmvG"><div class="EmailSubscript