i-v2 (1).jpg\",\"projectCardImageAltText\":\"Cleeaning\"},{\"title\":\"Air Conditioning Service \u0026 Repair\",\"projectCardType\":\"large\",\"rating\":\"4.67\",\"numberOfRatings\":\"(306k)\",\"price\":\"$$350\",\"link\":\"https://request.angi.com/service-request/task/40074\",\"projectCardImageUrl\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/central-a-or-c-service-or-repair-angi-v2.jpg\",\"projectCardImageAltText\":\"Central AC Repair or Service\"}]}},{\"name\":\"suggested-projects\",\"data\":{\"projectCardType\":\"large\",\"title\":\"Keep your home in tip-top shape\",\"disclaimer\":\"\",\"projectCards\":[{\"title\":\"Faucet \u0026 Plumbing Repair Services\",\"projectCardType\":\"large\",\"rating\":\"4.6\",\"numberOfRatings\":\"(568k)\",\"price\":\"$$226\",\"link\":\"https://request.angi.com/service-request/task/40113\",\"projectCardImageUrl\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/faucets-fixtures-and-pipes-repair-or-replace-angi-v2 (1).jpg\",\"projectCardImageAltText\":\"Faucets, fixtures \u0026 pipes\"},{\"title\":\"Roof Installation \u0026 Repair\",\"projectCardType\":\"large\",\"rating\":\"4.7\",\"numberOfRatings\":\"(325k)\",\"price\":\"$$471\",\"link\":\"https://request.angi.com/service-request/task/40133\",\"projectCardImageUrl\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/roofing-angi-v2 (1).jpg\",\"projectCardImageAltText\":\"Roofing\"},{\"title\":\"Bathroom Remodel\",\"projectCardType\":\"large\",\"rating\":\"4.4\",\"numberOfRatings\":\"(180k)\",\"price\":\"$$2,500\",\"link\":\"https://request.angi.com/service-request/task/40129\",\"projectCardImageUrl\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/bathroom-remodel-angi-v2 (1).jpg\",\"projectCardImageAltText\":\"Bathroom Remodel\"}]}},{\"name\":\"content-hub\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"The homeowners guide to home care is here\",\"subtitle\":\"From average costs to expert advice, get all the answers you need to get your job done.\",\"buttonText\":\"See All Articles\",\"teasers\":[{\"image\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/modern-laundry-room.jpg\",\"title\":\"How Much Does a Laundry Room Addition Cost? [2025 Data]\",\"text\":\"Building a laundry room addition to your home adds value and functionality. Your laundry room addition cost will depend on size, materials, and other factors.\",\"alt\":\"Modern Laundry Room\",\"date\":\"Feb 10, 2025\",\"author\":\"Deane Biermeier\",\"link\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/laundry-room-addition-cost.htm\",\"authorLink\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/deane-biermeier\"},{\"image\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/cosy-bedroom.jpg\",\"title\":\"How Much Does a Room Addition Cost? [2025 Data]\",\"text\":\"Building an addition can increase your home's value and provide more space to live, but it does come at a cost. Read on to learn how much it costs to build a room addition based on factors like location, type, and size. \",\"alt\":\"Interior of a cosy bedroom on a sunny day\",\"date\":\"Feb 3, 2025\",\"author\":\"Tyler Lacoma\",\"link\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-add-room.htm\",\"authorLink\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/tyler-lacoma\"},{\"image\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/interior-small-bathroom-plants-479525525.jpeg\",\"title\":\"How Much Does It Cost to Remodel a Small Bathroom? [2025 Data]\",\"text\":\"Small bathroom remodel costs depend on a number of factors—like what exactly you’re upgrading and the size of the room. This guide will help you budget.\",\"alt\":\"The interior of a small bathroom with plants over the bathtub\",\"date\":\"Feb 7, 2025\",\"author\":\"Samantha Hawrylack\",\"link\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-remodel-small-bathrooms-and-half-baths.htm\",\"authorLink\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/samantha-hawrylack\"},{\"image\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/handicapped-man-kitchen.jpg\",\"title\":\"How Much Does It Cost to Make My Home Wheelchair Accessible? [2025 Data]\",\"text\":\"Making your house more accessible is a must for many homeowners, especially those with disabilities or older adults. Here’s what to expect when planning for accessibility improvements.\",\"alt\":\"Man in wheelchair washes dishes\",\"date\":\"Jan 20, 2025\",\"author\":\"Mariel Loveland\",\"link\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-it-cost-make-my-home-handicap-accessible.htm\",\"authorLink\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/mariel-loveland\"},{\"image\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/bathroom-gray-tones-heated-floors-133612723.jpeg\",\"title\":\"How Much Does Shower Pan Replacement Cost? [2025 Data]\",\"text\":\"Shower pan replacement costs $530 to $2,700. Find out how material, shower size, labor, and more affect the final project budget.\",\"alt\":\"Bathroom in gray tones with heated floors\",\"date\":\"Feb 3, 2025\",\"author\":\"Samantha Hawrylack\",\"link\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/shower-pan-replacement-cost.htm\",\"authorLink\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/samantha-hawrylack\"},{\"image\":\"https://media.angi.com/s3fs-public/modern-bathroom-saoking-tub.jpg\",\"title\":\"How Much Does Bathtub Replacement Cost? [2025 Data]\",\"text\":\"An updated bathtub can give a bathroom a whole new look. Find out how much it costs to replace a bathtub, including prices by type and labor costs.\",\"alt\":\"Modern bathroom with a deep, freestanding soaking tub \",\"date\":\"Feb 6, 2025\",\"author\":\"Stephanie Mickelson\",\"link\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/how-much-does-bathtub-replacement-cost.htm\",\"authorLink\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles/author/stephanie-mickelson\"}],\"buttonUrl\":\"https://www.angi.com/articles\",\"backgroundColor\":\"mint\",\"showOnStickyNav\":false,\"stickyNavLinkName\":\"\",\"rightRailAligned\":false}},{\"name\":\"email-capture\",\"data\":{\"ctaText\":\"Sign me up\",\"title\":\"Knowledge is priceless - so our cost guides are free.\",\"subtitle\":\"Sign up to get free project cost info in your inbox.\",\"showOnStickyNav\":false,\"stickyNavLinkName\":\